From: V3 Gold <v3gold@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 23:32:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] V3 Gold: its own main menu, update checks and in-game
 menu controls

- The app starts on V3 Gold's main menu (GoldHomeRoute) instead of
  Vita3K's app list, which is still there as the Library. The menu walks
  through setup with Vita3K's own firmware and install screens and opens
  Vita3K's settings.
- MainActivity tells GoldLaunch whether it was just opened, so the menu
  can go straight into the game.
- No startup check for Vita3K updates; the Library's update check opens
  V3 Gold's.
- In-game menu: the Controls tab switches gestures on or off and shows
  the gesture guide (Vita3K's on-screen button settings while gestures
  are off), and the Session tab has Check for updates.
---
